### 1. High priority zahtev sa rokom, koji je isparavan treba da vrati 201
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "client_id" : 1,
    "title" : "Test zahtev sa rokom",
    "priority" : "high",
    "due_date" : "2026-12-01"
}


### 2. High priority bez roka, treba da vrati -> 422, zbog greske sa due_date
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "client_id" : 1,
    "title" : "High priority bez roka",
    "priority" : "high"
}

### 3. Prekratak naslov treba da baci gresku za naslov(title) -> 422
POST 127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "client_id" : 1,
    "title" : "aa",
    "priority" : "low"
}

### 4. Nepostojeci klijent, baca se greska 422, zbog client_id
POST 127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "client_id" : 999,
    "title" : "Neppostojeci klijent",
    "priority" : "low"
}

### 5. Kada saljemo prazno telo, 422 sa 3 greske -> client_id, title i priority
POST 127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

### 6. Low priority koji nema rok -> treba da se vrati 201
POST 127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "client_id" : 2,
    "title" : "Obican zahtev sa low priority koji nema rok",
    "priority" : "low"
}

### 7. Prebaciti u in_progress -> ocekivano 200
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests/6
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "status" : "in_progress"
}

### 8. Done status koji nema resolution -> greska 422, jer done mora imati resolution
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests/6
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "status" : "done"
}

### 9. Done koji ima resolution ali je resolution prekratak -> 422, jer je min 10 karaktera
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests/6
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "status" : "done",
    "resolution" : "kratko"
}

### 10. Done status koji ima ispravan resolution -> vraca 200
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests/6
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "status" : "done",
    "resolution" : "Dodat novi cenovnik za decembar"
}

### 11. Nepostojeci zahtev -> treba da vrati 404
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests/999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "status" : "in_progress"
}

### 12. Nedozvoljen status -> treba 422, greska za status
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/requests/6
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "status" : "zatvoreno"
}






















